            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Say “the head.” (Der Kopf.) Give its gender. (Masculine.) Why the capital? (It is a noun.) What did Kopf first mean? (A cup or bowl.) Name the related English word. (Cup.) Next: find the inherited word Haupt."
            }
          ]
        }
